// Legendary amulets: one per spell a hero can know (every class card, every form's card pool,
// every level-1 spell; a level-1 strike and its finisher share one),
// each modelled on a boss, enemy or Warcraft III hero who uses a bigger version of the spell; our
// names and words, the numbers tuned to the budget (docs/game/gear.md: +30 % to the
// hero's total damage; a heal +100 % to what it heals). A legendary roll's pool holds the
// legendaries of the spells the hero knows. Effects as in talents.ron (AbilityMod, Stat, Milestone,
// at rank 1); a note "pick" marks a number the proposals do not give. A heal or shield grows with
// the square root of its power: Power 3 heals twice as much.
([
    (
        spells: ["slam"],
        name: "Gruul's Shatter",
        icon: "Ability_Warrior_DecisiveStrike",
        text: "{Spell(1464)} deals 30% more. Every 4th {Spell(1464)} turns the enemies it hits to stone for 1 sec, then they shatter, each dealing 35% of its hit to enemies within 5 yd of it.",
        effects: [
            AbilityMod(filter: Spell("slam"), kind: Power, per_rank: 0.3),
            Milestone(Every(count: 4, per: Casts, filter: Spell("slam"), then: [Afflict(chance: 1, effect: Stun(seconds: 1), trigger: Hit, filter: Spell("slam")), Burst(share: 0.35, of: Hit, radius: 5, at: Target, delay: 1, trigger: Hit, filter: Spell("slam"))])),
